  "title": "FLM 2 · Sentences, Utterances and Propositions pp.16-18 (sessions 3–4)|||FLM 2 · Sentences, Utterances and Propositions pp.16-18 (buổi 3–4)",
  "description": "Sessions 3–4 of the FLM plan.|||Buổi 3–4 theo kế hoạch FLM.",
