  "title": "FLM 22 · Perlocutions and Illocutions pp.269-276: Types of sentence, Perlocutionary Act, Illocutio… (sessions 45–46)|||FLM 22 · Perlocutions and Illocutions pp.269-276: Types of sentence, Perlocutionary Act, Illocutio… (buổi 45–46)",
  "description": "Sessions 45–46 of the FLM plan.|||Buổi 45–46 theo kế hoạch FLM.",
